speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, my question is for the Minister of Agriculture.
In view of a statement by Mr. Philippe Parizeau, president of the Granby Agricultural Cooperative, which is the largest in our country, that there is now a shortage of milk in Canada and particularly in Quebec, is it the intention of the Minister of Agriculture to increase, as from April 1, 1971, the total figure of dairy production quotas of the Dairy Commission for the year 1971-72, and also to put an end to the penalizing of dairy producers?
[English}
